OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry at first. Rain,
OL,6,Fheavy at times, will spread east
OL,7,Fduring the morning. The wind will
OL,8,Fstrengthen from the morning, reaching
OL,9,Fgale to severe gale later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRain soon clearing the east,
OL,12,Fthen dry for a brief time before
OL,13,Ffrequent showers arrive through the
OL,14,Fevening and overnight. Becoming windy
OL,15,Fwith Storm Boelo bringing gales or
OL,16,Fsevere gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
