OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FStorm Boelo brings gales or
OL,6,Fsevere gales, easing from the west
OL,7,Flater in the day. Frequent showers in
OL,8,Fthe morning, heavy at times, with
OL,9,Fdrier interludes developing from the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,13,Fand bright morning Monday, becoming
OL,14,Fwindy with rain later. Very windy on
OL,15,FTuesday with showers, some heavy.
OL,16,FWinds easing overnight into Wednesday,
OL,17,Fthen bright spells and scattered
OL,18,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
